    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Inbox duplicates suppressed",
      "description": "Messages the inbox recognised as already processed and skipped.\n\nNOT an error graph - it is the proof that at-least-once delivery is being absorbed correctly, and a healthy system shows a non-zero trickle. Zero forever is suspicious: either the broker has never redelivered anything, or the dedup key is wrong and duplicates are getting through as fresh work.\n\nMetric: dpe.inbox.duplicate",
