    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Gate outcomes",
      "description": "What the idempotency gate decided, per request.\n\n`replay` is the mechanism working - a client retried and got the first answer back instead of a second payment. `conflict` is a client reusing one key for a DIFFERENT body, which is a bug in the caller and worth seeing. `in_flight` is a duplicate that arrived while the first was still running.\n\nMetric: dpe.idempotency.request{outcome}",
