    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Redis fast path - hit ratio and availability",
      "description": "Redis is a cache and an anti-stampede lock, never a correctness dependency. This panel exists to make that claim falsifiable: `docker compose stop redis` should send the hit ratio to zero and change NOTHING on any other panel except latency.\n\nMetric: dpe.idempotency.cache{result=hit|miss|unavailable}",
